                                                "sense_id": "78ac7969-c14a-3c10-a375-2abb5e7358fe",
                                                "text": "It was very tiring and slow work, yet I did visibly gain ground; and as we drew near the Cape of the Woods, though I saw I must infallibly miss that point, I had still made some hundred yards of easting."
