                                                "sense_id": "71e62266-7a0a-3333-ba07-36b38ac46d74",
                                                "text": "He had, in truth, drunk very little - not a fourth of the quantity which a systematic tippler could carry to church on a Sunday afternoon without a hitch in his eastings or genuflections; but the weakness of Sir John's constitution made mountains of his petty sins in this kind."
